   "texto": [
    "The **peng-…-an** prefix and suffix can form action or process names such as **mencegah → pencegahan** («prevenir → prevención») and **menggunakan → penggunaan** («use → use»). The concrete form and meaning depend on the word and the context.",
    "In Spanish many translations end up in **-ción**, but correspondence is not automatic. Look at the verbal root and the function that meets the name within the sentence."
